WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:25.958
- Yes! Battle Royale for championship! Where we dropping, boys?

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.083
- Same as always, the highest point on the map?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.500
- Yes! The ideal location to be good at home but never win conference! 

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:33.833
To mountain!

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:38.375
- Go Cow Town! Oh, yeah, a legendary chest!

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.958
We’re finally gonna get the Kings’ first Victory Royale!

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:43.291
Nope. 

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.333
Just gray guns, and a note from Vlade saying he traded away all the good stuff.

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:48.958
What did the Lakers get?

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.541
- Purple and gold.

00:00:58.125 --> 00:00:59.458
- We’ve got a sweet loadout here.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.250
- Yeah, but for once, we’ve got to cut the crap and play together.

00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:03.500
Hey, where’s Ben?

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:04.625
- Over here, mate! 

00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:05.958
I'm a bush!

00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:07.708
- Please get out of the bush, Ben.

00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:10.083
- No. It’s perfect camouflage!

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:15.208
I’m 50 percent point guard, 50 percent power forward, 100 percent bush.

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:17.666
- Dammit, Ben. No one wants to play with a bush camper. 

00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:18.458
Right, Joel?

00:01:19.041 --> 00:01:19.375
Joel?

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:21.416
- He’s in the bush with me now!

00:01:21.875 --> 00:01:26.291
- Come on in, Al. If you wanna be part of The Process, you gotta be part of the bush.

00:01:27.916 --> 00:01:32.125
- Where the heck is Harden?! I swear, all he cares about is getting the latest skins.

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:34.916
- Check it out! Hottest skin in the game!

00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:39.291
- Private Westbrook reporting for duty. With a knockwurst pickaxe!

00:01:39.916 --> 00:01:42.416
- I gotta have a word with my guy at the item shop.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.041
- ¡Qué suerte! Things are looking good!

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:51.458
The storm is closing in, and Giannis will never make it.

00:01:51.958 --> 00:01:54.708
- I don’t know, I heard he can Eurostep the entire island.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.541
- That’s impossible! No one can--

00:01:58.708 --> 00:02:00.500
- Only three steps. Not a travel!

00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:03.708
This should’ve been mine.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:08.750
- Well, Kawhi, I guess there’s only two teams left in the battle for the West.

00:02:09.333 --> 00:02:10.166
- No, there’s not!

00:02:10.625 --> 00:02:13.416
Beef Boss! This skin isn’t even available right now.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.333
No way Russ can beat this one.

00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:18.750
- Check it out! Beef Boss with a dog backpack! 

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.208
And the dog has a DJ horn!

00:02:23.708 --> 00:02:25.833
- Wise investment of V-Bucks! 

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:27.583
And don’t forget Nuggets!

00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:28.583
- Or Milwaukee! 

00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:31.458
We control the East, and this attractive bush.

00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:36.125
- We’ve gotta get closer, Joel. I can only shoot from within three feet.

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:40.375
- Whoa. What’s going on?

00:02:41.291 --> 00:02:43.250
- I’m afraid we had a technical glitch.

00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:46.958
Sorry, guys, but the game’s over for now. We have to reboot.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:48.166
- Reboot?

00:02:48.875 --> 00:02:49.625
So what happens now?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.500
- We’re all going to Disney World!

00:02:53.375 --> 00:02:53.666
- Really?

00:02:54.916 --> 00:02:57.708
- Some of us are going to Disney World! 

